@startuml
!theme plain
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title repo-current-state — From Verified Repository Truth to Recovery Snapshot

actor "Maintainer / Agent" as maintainer
rectangle "Merged delivery\nSource branch deleted\nDefault branch synchronized" as delivery
database "GitHub Issues\nPlan / Ticket status" as issues
rectangle "Repository evidence\nGit state / files / config / issue status" as evidence
component "repo-current-state\nVerification rules" as skill
file "docs/Repo_Current_State.md\nCompact verified recovery point" as snapshot
folder "Canonical documentation\nREADME + docs/" as docs

maintainer --> skill : Request state reconciliation
delivery --> evidence : Supply post-merge repository truth
issues --> evidence : Supply durable work status
skill --> evidence : Verify only relevant facts
evidence --> snapshot : Replace stale snapshot facts
snapshot --> docs : Link to detailed canonical owners
snapshot --> maintainer : Provide exact recovery point

note right of snapshot
Current verified state only:
not backlog, transcript, or Issue duplicate.
end note
@enduml
